      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0",
      "artist": "Takver from Australia",
      "description": "The mountain was enshrouded with cloud the afternoon I arrived in New Plymouth, but the next morning it was a beautiful sight entirely free of cloud when we visited the North Egmont Visitor Centre and Mountain Cafe.\nBy the time we left - late morning - the clouds had started moving in once again enshrouding the mountain. Would love to visit the region again and do some longer walks.\nSee the Department of Conservation website for North Egmont Tramping Tracks\n\nAn April 2012 two week holiday to the north island of New Zealand.",
